causal_discovery/dagma_torch.py is a PyTorch port of dagma/linear.py from DAGMA
(https://github.com/kevinsbello/dagma), Copyright Kevin Bello and contributors,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The algorithm and its default
settings are unchanged; the port moves the computation from NumPy/SciPy to
PyTorch and accepts a covariance matrix instead of the data matrix.

The optional fGES method calls Tetrad (https://github.com/cmu-phil/tetrad,
GPL-3.0) through py-tetrad (https://github.com/cmu-phil/py-tetrad, MIT).
Neither is included in this repository; pip downloads them when the "fges"
extra is installed.
